stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> ToDo

    ToDo: To Do<br/>label — ready-for-agent<br/>assignee — nobody yet
    InProgress: In Progress<br/>label — ready-for-agent<br/>assignee — the engineer
    InReview: In Review<br/>label — ready-for-human<br/>assignee — the engineer
    Done: Done<br/>label — none, removed<br/>assignee — the engineer
    Blocked: Blocked<br/>label — ready-for-human<br/>assignee — the engineer, still

    ToDo --> InProgress: claimed
    InProgress --> InReview: review clean + criteria ticked — PR follows on go
    InReview --> Done: approved, merged
    InReview --> InProgress: changes requested — the label goes back
    InProgress --> Blocked: someone outside the team must act
    Blocked --> InProgress: the block is removed — back to where the work really is
    ToDo --> Blocked: an outside dependency known before anyone starts
    Blocked --> ToDo: the block is removed, and nothing had started yet
    Done --> [*]
